    "10.7.0.1 takes the connection, but the phone's remote pairing service does not answer through it, so this page can show Working while Qeno cannot connect. Reconnect your proxy app or LocalDevVPN, then pair again in Setup \u203a Pairing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u91cd\u65b0\u8fde\u63a5 LocalDevVPN \u6216\u4ee3\u7406 App\uff0c\u518d\u5230\u201c\u914d\u7f6e \u203a \u914d\u5bf9\u201d\u91cd\u65b0\u914d\u5bf9\u300210.7.0.1 \u5df2\u8fde\u901a\uff0c\u4f46\u8fdc\u7a0b\u914d\u5bf9\u670d\u52a1\u672a\u54cd\u5e94\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u91cd\u65b0\u9023\u7dda LocalDevVPN \u6216\u4ee3\u7406 App\uff0c\u518d\u5230\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u7cbe\u9748 \u203a \u914d\u5c0d\u300d\u91cd\u65b0\u914d\u5c0d\u300210.7.0.1 \u5df2\u9023\u901a\uff0c\u4f46\u9060\u7aef\u914d\u5c0d\u670d\u52d9\u672a\u56de\u61c9\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reconnect LocalDevVPN or your proxy app, then pair again in Setup \u203a Pairing. 10.7.0.1 accepts connections, but remote pairing isn\u2019t answering through it."
