    "A free Apple Account works. Qeno signs itself for 7 days at a time and gets ready to sign again before then. Your Apple ID and password go only to Apple. The anisette server Qeno asks for its device headers never sees them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u514d\u8d39 Apple \u8d26\u6237\u5373\u53ef\u4f7f\u7528\u3002Qeno \u6bcf\u6b21\u7b7e\u540d\u6709\u6548\u671f 7 \u5929\uff0c\u5230\u671f\u524d\u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u51c6\u5907\u7eed\u7b7e\u3002Apple ID \u548c\u5bc6\u7801\u4ec5\u53d1\u9001\u7ed9 Apple\uff0canisette \u670d\u52a1\u5668\u65e0\u6cd5\u8bfb\u53d6\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u514d\u8cbb Apple \u5e33\u865f\u5373\u53ef\u4f7f\u7528\u3002Qeno \u6bcf\u6b21\u7c3d\u540d\u6709\u6548\u671f 7 \u5929\uff0c\u5230\u671f\u524d\u6703\u81ea\u52d5\u6e96\u5099\u7e8c\u7c3d\u3002Apple ID \u548c\u5bc6\u78bc\u50c5\u50b3\u9001\u7d66 Apple\uff0canisette \u4f3a\u670d\u5668\u7121\u6cd5\u8b80\u53d6\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A free Apple Account works. Qeno signs itself for 7 days at a time and prepares the next renewal automatically. Your Apple ID and password go only to Apple; the anisette server never sees them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
