    "An agent is waiting. Open Qeno so it can see the screen again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u6253\u5f00 Qeno\uff0c\u4ee5\u4fbf\u7b49\u5f85\u4e2d\u7684\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u6062\u590d\u8bfb\u53d6\u5c4f\u5e55\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u958b\u555f Qeno\uff0c\u4ee5\u4fbf\u7b49\u5f85\u4e2d\u7684\u667a\u6167\u9ad4\u6062\u5fa9\u8b80\u53d6\u87a2\u5e55\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Qeno so the waiting agent can see the screen again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An agent saves a routine after a task that worked. The next time it repeats the task in one step and stops where the screen differs. Swipe a routine to forget it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4efb\u52a1\u6210\u529f\u540e\uff0c\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u4f1a\u4fdd\u5b58\u6d41\u7a0b\u4ee5\u4fbf\u4e0b\u6b21\u4e00\u6b65\u91cd\u653e\uff0c\u9047\u5230\u754c\u9762\u53d8\u5316\u5219\u81ea\u52a8\u505c\u4e0b\u3002\u8f7b\u626b\u53ef\u5220\u9664\u6d41\u7a0b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4efb\u52d9\u6210\u529f\u5f8c\uff0c\u667a\u6167\u9ad4\u6703\u5132\u5b58\u6d41\u7a0b\u4ee5\u4fbf\u4e0b\u6b21\u4e00\u6b65\u91cd\u653e\uff0c\u9047\u5230\u756b\u9762\u8b8a\u5316\u5247\u81ea\u52d5\u505c\u4e0b\u3002\u8f15\u6383\u53ef\u522a\u9664\u6d41\u7a0b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After a successful task, an agent saves a routine to repeat it in one step next time, pausing if the screen differs. Swipe to forget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An agent saves a routine after a task that worked; the next time it repeats the task in one step and stops where the screen differs. Swipe a routine to forget it.": {
