          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live voice is a spoken conversation with OpenAI\u2019s Realtime model. It listens, taps and types, and answers out loud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b9e\u65f6\u8bed\u97f3\u901a\u8fc7 OpenAI Realtime \u6a21\u578b\u8fdb\u884c\u8bed\u97f3\u5bf9\u8bdd\uff0c\u652f\u6301\u8fb9\u542c\u8fb9\u64cd\u4f5c\u5e76\u6717\u8bfb\u56de\u7b54\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5373\u6642\u8a9e\u97f3\u900f\u904e OpenAI Realtime \u6a21\u578b\u9032\u884c\u8a9e\u97f3\u5c0d\u8a71\uff0c\u652f\u63f4\u908a\u807d\u908a\u64cd\u4f5c\u4e26\u6717\u8b80\u56de\u7b54\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live Voice is a spoken conversation with OpenAI\u2019s Realtime model. Qeno listens, acts on screen, and replies aloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live voice is a spoken conversation with OpenAI\u2019s Realtime model: it listens, taps and types, and answers out loud.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live Voice is a spoken conversation with OpenAI\u2019s Realtime model. Qeno listens, acts on screen, and replies aloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b9e\u65f6\u8bed\u97f3\u901a\u8fc7 OpenAI Realtime \u6a21\u578b\u8fdb\u884c\u8bed\u97f3\u5bf9\u8bdd\uff0c\u652f\u6301\u8fb9\u542c\u8fb9\u64cd\u4f5c\u5e76\u6717\u8bfb\u56de\u7b54\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5373\u6642\u8a9e\u97f3\u900f\u904e OpenAI Realtime \u6a21\u578b\u9032\u884c\u8a9e\u97f3\u5c0d\u8a71\uff0c\u652f\u63f4\u908a\u807d\u908a\u64cd\u4f5c\u4e26\u6717\u8b80\u56de\u7b54\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live voice needs an OpenAI API key (tap here for Model) or the voice bridge. The microphone in the field dictates with any model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f7f\u7528\u5b9e\u65f6\u8bed\u97f3\u9700\u6dfb\u52a0 OpenAI API \u5bc6\u94a5\uff08\u8f7b\u70b9\u524d\u5f80\u201c\u5927\u8111\u201d\uff09\u6216\u914d\u7f6e\u8bed\u97f3\u6865\u63a5\u3002\u8f93\u5165\u6846\u542c\u5199\u652f\u6301\u6240\u6709\u6a21\u578b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4f7f\u7528\u5373\u6642\u8a9e\u97f3\u9700\u65b0\u589e OpenAI API \u91d1\u9470\uff08\u8f15\u9ede\u524d\u5f80\u300c\u5927\u8166\u300d\uff09\u6216\u8a2d\u5b9a\u8a9e\u97f3\u6a4b\u63a5\u3002\u8f38\u5165\u6846\u807d\u5beb\u652f\u63f4\u6240\u6709\u6a21\u578b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add an OpenAI API key (tap for Brain) or set up a voice bridge to use Live Voice. Message dictation works with any model."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live voice runs on OpenAI\u2019s Realtime API, which only an OpenAI API key can open. Dictation in the message field works with this account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b9e\u65f6\u8bed\u97f3\u57fa\u4e8e OpenAI Realtime API\uff0c\u9700\u4f7f\u7528 OpenAI API \u5bc6\u94a5\u3002\u8f93\u5165\u6846\u542c\u5199\u53ef\u4f7f\u7528\u6b64\u8d26\u6237\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5373\u6642\u8a9e\u97f3\u57fa\u65bc OpenAI Realtime API\uff0c\u9700\u4f7f\u7528 OpenAI API \u91d1\u9470\u3002\u8f38\u5165\u6846\u807d\u5beb\u53ef\u4f7f\u7528\u6b64\u5e33\u865f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live Voice runs on OpenAI Realtime and requires an OpenAI API key. Message dictation works with this account."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live voice uses OpenAI Realtime, which needs an OpenAI API key in Qeno \u203a Brain. Dictation in the message field works with any model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b9e\u65f6\u8bed\u97f3\u4f7f\u7528 OpenAI Realtime\uff0c\u9700\u5728\u201cQeno \u203a \u5927\u8111\u201d\u4e2d\u6dfb\u52a0 OpenAI API \u5bc6\u94a5\u3002\u8f93\u5165\u6846\u542c\u5199\u652f\u6301\u6240\u6709\u6a21\u578b\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live Voice uses OpenAI Realtime and requires an OpenAI API key in Qeno \u203a Brain. Message dictation works with any model."
