            "value": "\u8acb\u91cd\u958b Qeno \u6216\u7528\u7c3d\u540d\u5de5\u5177\u91cd\u88dd\u3002\u7121\u6cd5\u5f9e\u9470\u5319\u5708\u8b80\u53d6\u4e2d\u8f49\u91d1\u9470\uff08%lld\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reopen Qeno or reinstall with your signing tool. Couldn\u2019t read the relay key from Keychain (%lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno downloads and signs updates from this channel ahead of time, the same way Qeno Setup does. Stable gets full releases only. Beta, Alpha and Pre-alpha get earlier builds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u4f1a\u4ece\u6b64\u901a\u9053\u53ca\u66f4\u7a33\u5b9a\u7684\u901a\u9053\u51c6\u5907\u66f4\u65b0\u3002\u5982\u679c\u5747\u65e0\u53ef\u7528\u7248\u672c\uff0c\u4f1a\u4f7f\u7528\u4e0b\u4e00\u4e2a\u6709\u7248\u672c\u7684\u8f83\u4e0d\u7a33\u5b9a\u901a\u9053\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u6703\u5f9e\u6b64\u901a\u9053\u53ca\u66f4\u7a69\u5b9a\u7684\u901a\u9053\u6e96\u5099\u66f4\u65b0\u3002\u5982\u679c\u5747\u7121\u53ef\u7528\u7248\u672c\uff0c\u6703\u4f7f\u7528\u4e0b\u4e00\u500b\u6709\u7248\u672c\u7684\u8f03\u4e0d\u7a69\u5b9a\u901a\u9053\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno prepares updates from this channel and more stable channels. If none has a release, it uses the next available less stable channel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno downloads it again by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u91cd\u65b0\u4e0b\u8f7d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno will download it again automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u6703\u81ea\u52d5\u91cd\u65b0\u4e0b\u8f09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno gets the next build ready by itself, %@ days before it expires or when your channel has an update. It installs only when you tap Install.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u4f1a\u5728\u5230\u671f\u524d %@ \u5929\u6216\u6240\u9009\u66f4\u65b0\u901a\u9053\u6709\u65b0\u7248\u672c\u65f6\u81ea\u52a8\u51c6\u5907\u5b89\u88c5\u5305\uff0c\u4ec5\u5728\u4f60\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c\u5b89\u88c5\u201d\u540e\u624d\u4f1a\u5b89\u88c5\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u6703\u5728\u5230\u671f\u524d %@ \u5929\u6216\u6240\u9078\u66f4\u65b0\u901a\u9053\u6709\u65b0\u7248\u672c\u6642\u81ea\u52d5\u6e96\u5099\u5b89\u88dd\u5305\uff0c\u50c5\u5728\u4f60\u8f15\u9ede\u300c\u5b89\u88dd\u300d\u5f8c\u624d\u6703\u5b89\u88dd\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno prepares the next build automatically %@ days before expiration or when your release channel has an update. It installs only when you tap Install."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno gets the next build ready by itself, %lld days before it expires or when your channel has an update. It installs only when you tap Install.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u4f1a\u5728\u5230\u671f\u524d %lld \u5929\u6216\u6240\u9009\u66f4\u65b0\u901a\u9053\u6709\u65b0\u7248\u672c\u65f6\u81ea\u52a8\u51c6\u5907\u5b89\u88c5\u5305\uff0c\u4ec5\u5728\u4f60\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c\u5b89\u88c5\u201d\u540e\u624d\u4f1a\u5b89\u88c5\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u6703\u5728\u5230\u671f\u524d %lld \u5929\u6216\u6240\u9078\u66f4\u65b0\u901a\u9053\u6709\u65b0\u7248\u672c\u6642\u81ea\u52d5\u6e96\u5099\u5b89\u88dd\u5305\uff0c\u50c5\u5728\u4f60\u8f15\u9ede\u300c\u5b89\u88dd\u300d\u5f8c\u624d\u6703\u5b89\u88dd\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno prepares the next build automatically %lld days before expiration or when your release channel has an update. It installs only when you tap Install."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno has no default relay. Deploy your own to your Cloudflare account with deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh from the Qeno repository, then enter the address it prints. Screenshots and taps pass only through that relay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u6ca1\u6709\u9ed8\u8ba4\u4e2d\u8f6c\u3002\u8bf7\u7528 Qeno \u4ed3\u5e93\u4e2d\u7684 deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh \u628a\u4e2d\u8f6c\u90e8\u7f72\u5230\u4f60\u81ea\u5df1\u7684 Cloudflare \u8d26\u6237\uff0c\u518d\u8f93\u5165\u5b83\u8f93\u51fa\u7684\u5730\u5740\u3002\u622a\u56fe\u548c\u8f7b\u70b9\u53ea\u7ecf\u8fc7\u8fd9\u4e2a\u4e2d\u8f6c\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u6c92\u6709\u9810\u8a2d\u4e2d\u8f49\u3002\u8acb\u7528 Qeno \u5009\u5eab\u4e2d\u7684 deploy/cf-relay/deploy.sh \u628a\u4e2d\u8f49\u90e8\u7f72\u5230\u4f60\u81ea\u5df1\u7684 Cloudflare \u8cec\u6236\uff0c\u518d\u8f38\u5165\u5b83\u8f38\u51fa\u7684\u5730\u5740\u3002\u622a\u5716\u548c\u8f15\u9ede\u53ea\u7d93\u904e\u9019\u500b\u4e2d\u8f49\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno is browsing": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6d4f\u89c8\u4e2d"
