            "value": "Qeno \u4f1a\u5728 GitHub \u4e0a\u68c0\u67e5\u6240\u9009\u66f4\u65b0\u901a\u9053\u7684\u6700\u65b0\u7248\u672c\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u6703\u5728 GitHub \u4e0a\u6aa2\u67e5\u6240\u9078\u66f4\u65b0\u901a\u9053\u7684\u6700\u65b0\u7248\u672c\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno checks GitHub for the latest build on the selected release channel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno needs a model account before it can reply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u5148\u6dfb\u52a0\u6a21\u578b\u8d26\u6237\uff0cQeno \u624d\u80fd\u56de\u590d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add a model account so Qeno can reply."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u5148\u65b0\u589e\u6a21\u578b\u5e33\u865f\uff0cQeno \u624d\u80fd\u56de\u8986\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno needs attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u9700\u8981\u4f60\u5904\u7406"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno needs every item ticked before an agent or the chat can use this iPhone. Items tick themselves when the phone can check them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b8c\u6210\u5168\u90e8\u9879\u76ee\u540e\uff0c\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u548c\u5bf9\u8bdd\u5373\u53ef\u4f7f\u7528\u6b64 iPhone\u3002\u53ef\u81ea\u52a8\u68c0\u6d4b\u7684\u9879\u76ee\u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u52fe\u9009\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5b8c\u6210\u5168\u90e8\u9805\u76ee\u5f8c\uff0c\u667a\u6167\u9ad4\u548c\u5c0d\u8a71\u5373\u53ef\u4f7f\u7528\u6b64 iPhone\u3002\u53ef\u81ea\u52d5\u6aa2\u6e2c\u7684\u9805\u76ee\u6703\u81ea\u52d5\u52fe\u9078\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Complete every item so agents and chat can use this iPhone. Checkable items update automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno needs it once after each restart, then tries again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6bcf\u6b21\u91cd\u542f\u540e\u9700\u8054\u7f51\u4e00\u6b21\uff0c\u968f\u540e\u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u91cd\u8bd5\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno needs internet once after each restart, then retries automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6bcf\u6b21\u91cd\u555f\u5f8c\u9700\u9023\u7db2\u4e00\u6b21\uff0c\u96a8\u5f8c\u6703\u81ea\u52d5\u91cd\u8a66\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno needs the internet once after each restart of the phone to get Apple's signature for the developer disk image. Check Wi-Fi or cellular; Qeno tries again by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u68c0\u67e5 Wi-Fi \u6216\u8702\u7a9d\u7f51\u7edc\u3002\u624b\u673a\u91cd\u542f\u540e\u9700\u8054\u7f51\u4e00\u6b21\u83b7\u53d6 Apple \u78c1\u76d8\u6620\u50cf\u7b7e\u540d\uff0cQeno \u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u91cd\u8bd5\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u6aa2\u67e5 Wi-Fi \u6216\u884c\u52d5\u7db2\u8def\u3002\u624b\u6a5f\u91cd\u555f\u5f8c\u9700\u9023\u7db2\u4e00\u6b21\u53d6\u5f97 Apple \u78c1\u789f\u6620\u50cf\u7c3d\u540d\uff0cQeno \u6703\u81ea\u52d5\u91cd\u8a66\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check Wi-Fi or cellular. After a restart, Qeno needs internet once for Apple\u2019s disk image signature and retries automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno needs the microphone and speech recognition. Allow them in Settings \u203a Qeno.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u5728\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a Qeno\u201d\u4e2d\u5f00\u542f\u9ea6\u514b\u98ce\u548c\u8bed\u97f3\u8bc6\u522b\u6743\u9650\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u5728\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a \u203a Qeno\u300d\u4e2d\u958b\u555f\u9ea5\u514b\u98a8\u8207\u8a9e\u97f3\u8fa8\u8b58\u6b0a\u9650\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow Microphone and Speech Recognition in Settings \u203a Qeno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno needs the microphone and speech recognition: allow them in Settings \u203a Qeno.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow Microphone and Speech Recognition in Settings \u203a Qeno."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u5728\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a Qeno\u201d\u4e2d\u5f00\u542f\u9ea6\u514b\u98ce\u548c\u8bed\u97f3\u8bc6\u522b\u6743\u9650\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u5728\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a \u203a Qeno\u300d\u4e2d\u958b\u555f\u9ea5\u514b\u98a8\u8207\u8a9e\u97f3\u8fa8\u8b58\u6b0a\u9650\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno needs your OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u9700\u8981\u4f60\u6279\u51c6"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno opens the main Settings page. Go to **Privacy & Security \u203a Developer Mode** and tap **Pair with Qeno**.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5373\u5c06\u6253\u5f00\u7cfb\u7edf\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u201d\u9996\u9875\u3002\u8bf7\u524d\u5f80\u201c**\u9690\u79c1\u4e0e\u5b89\u5168 \u203a \u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f**\u201d\uff0c\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c**\u4e0e Qeno \u914d\u5bf9**\u201d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5373\u5c07\u958b\u555f\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u300d\u3002\u8acb\u524d\u5f80\u300c**\u96b1\u79c1\u6b0a\u8207\u5b89\u5168\u6027 \u203a \u958b\u767c\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f**\u300d\uff0c\u8f15\u9ede\u300c**\u8207 Qeno \u914d\u5c0d**\u300d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno opens the main Settings page. Go to **Privacy & Security \u203a Developer Mode** and tap **Pair with Qeno**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno prepares updates from this channel and more stable channels. If none has a release, it uses the next available less stable channel.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno prepares updates from this channel and more stable channels. If none has a release, it uses the next available less stable channel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u4f1a\u4ece\u6b64\u901a\u9053\u53ca\u66f4\u7a33\u5b9a\u7684\u901a\u9053\u51c6\u5907\u66f4\u65b0\u3002\u5982\u679c\u5747\u65e0\u53ef\u7528\u7248\u672c\uff0c\u4f1a\u4f7f\u7528\u4e0b\u4e00\u4e2a\u6709\u7248\u672c\u7684\u8f83\u4e0d\u7a33\u5b9a\u901a\u9053\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u6703\u5f9e\u6b64\u901a\u9053\u53ca\u66f4\u7a69\u5b9a\u7684\u901a\u9053\u6e96\u5099\u66f4\u65b0\u3002\u5982\u679c\u5747\u7121\u53ef\u7528\u7248\u672c\uff0c\u6703\u4f7f\u7528\u4e0b\u4e00\u500b\u6709\u7248\u672c\u7684\u8f03\u4e0d\u7a69\u5b9a\u901a\u9053\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno restarted so agents can see the screen again. It turns on when it opens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u5df2\u91cd\u542f\u4ee5\u4fbf\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u6062\u590d\u8bfb\u53d6\u5c4f\u5e55\uff0c\u6253\u5f00\u540e\u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u5f00\u542f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u5df2\u91cd\u555f\u4ee5\u4fbf\u667a\u6167\u9ad4\u6062\u5fa9\u8b80\u53d6\u87a2\u5e55\uff0c\u958b\u555f\u5f8c\u6703\u81ea\u52d5\u958b\u555f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno restarted so agents can see the screen again. It turns on automatically when opened."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno sends touches and keys over a screen-sharing session, and iOS turns the camera off in every app while one is open, so Qeno opens it only for an action and closes it 5 seconds after the last one. With this on (the default), Qeno opens no session at all, so the camera is never affected. If taps and typing stop working, turn it off. Takes effect the next time Qeno turns on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u901a\u8fc7\u5c4f\u5e55\u5171\u4eab\u4f1a\u8bdd\u53d1\u9001\u89e6\u63a7\u548c\u6309\u952e\uff0c\u800c\u4f1a\u8bdd\u6253\u5f00\u671f\u95f4 iOS \u4f1a\u5173\u95ed\u6240\u6709 App \u7684\u76f8\u673a\uff0c\u56e0\u6b64 Qeno \u53ea\u5728\u64cd\u4f5c\u65f6\u6253\u5f00\u4f1a\u8bdd\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u6700\u540e\u4e00\u6b21\u64cd\u4f5c 5 \u79d2\u540e\u5173\u95ed\u3002\u5f00\u542f\u6b64\u9879\uff08\u9ed8\u8ba4\uff09\u540e\uff0cQeno \u5b8c\u5168\u4e0d\u6253\u5f00\u4f1a\u8bdd\uff0c\u76f8\u673a\u4e0d\u53d7\u4efb\u4f55\u5f71\u54cd\u3002\u5982\u679c\u8f7b\u70b9\u548c\u952e\u5165\u5931\u6548\uff0c\u8bf7\u5173\u95ed\u6b64\u9879\u3002\u4e0b\u6b21\u5f00\u542f Qeno \u65f6\u751f\u6548\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u900f\u904e\u87a2\u5e55\u5171\u4eab\u6703\u8a71\u50b3\u9001\u89f8\u63a7\u548c\u6309\u9375\uff0c\u800c\u6703\u8a71\u958b\u555f\u671f\u9593 iOS \u6703\u95dc\u9589\u6240\u6709 App \u7684\u76f8\u6a5f\uff0c\u56e0\u6b64 Qeno \u53ea\u5728\u64cd\u4f5c\u6642\u958b\u555f\u6703\u8a71\uff0c\u4e26\u5728\u6700\u5f8c\u4e00\u6b21\u64cd\u4f5c 5 \u79d2\u5f8c\u95dc\u9589\u3002\u958b\u555f\u6b64\u9805\uff08\u9810\u8a2d\uff09\u5f8c\uff0cQeno \u5b8c\u5168\u4e0d\u958b\u555f\u6703\u8a71\uff0c\u76f8\u6a5f\u4e0d\u53d7\u4efb\u4f55\u5f71\u97ff\u3002\u5982\u679c\u8f15\u9ede\u548c\u9375\u5165\u5931\u6548\uff0c\u8acb\u95dc\u9589\u6b64\u9805\u3002\u4e0b\u6b21\u958b\u555f Qeno \u6642\u751f\u6548\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno sends touches and keys over a screen-sharing session, and iOS turns the camera off in every app while one is open, so Qeno opens it only for an action and closes it 5 seconds after the last one. With this on, Qeno opens no session at all. If taps and typing still work, the camera is never affected; if they stop working, turn it off. Takes effect the next time Qeno turns on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u9ed8\u8ba4\u901a\u8fc7\u5c4f\u5e55\u5171\u4eab\u4f1a\u8bdd\u53d1\u9001\u89e6\u63a7\u548c\u6309\u952e\uff08\u4f1a\u8bdd\u671f\u95f4 iOS \u4f1a\u5173\u95ed\u76f8\u673a\uff09\u3002\u5f00\u542f\u6b64\u9879\u540e\u4e0d\u518d\u5efa\u7acb\u8be5\u4f1a\u8bdd\uff0c\u76f8\u673a\u4e0d\u53d7\u5f71\u54cd\uff1b\u82e5\u70b9\u51fb\u6216\u8f93\u5165\u5931\u6548\u8bf7\u5173\u95ed\u6b64\u9879\u3002\u4e0b\u6b21\u5f00\u542f Qeno \u65f6\u751f\u6548\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno sends touches and keys over a screen-sharing session, which disables cameras while open, so Qeno opens it only during actions. With this on, Qeno opens no session at all so cameras stay unaffected; turn it off if taps or typing stop working. Takes effect next time Qeno turns on."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u9810\u8a2d\u900f\u904e\u87a2\u5e55\u5171\u4eab\u5de5\u4f5c\u968e\u6bb5\u50b3\u9001\u89f8\u63a7\u548c\u6309\u9375\uff08\u5de5\u4f5c\u968e\u6bb5\u671f\u9593 iOS \u6703\u95dc\u9589\u76f8\u6a5f\uff09\u3002\u958b\u555f\u6b64\u9805\u5f8c\u4e0d\u518d\u5efa\u7acb\u8a72\u5de5\u4f5c\u968e\u6bb5\uff0c\u76f8\u6a5f\u4e0d\u53d7\u5f71\u97ff\uff1b\u82e5\u9ede\u64ca\u6216\u8f38\u5165\u5931\u6548\u8acb\u95dc\u9589\u6b64\u9805\u3002\u4e0b\u6b21\u958b\u555f Qeno \u6642\u751f\u6548\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno shows steps, pairing codes and approvals on the Lock Screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u4f1a\u5728\u9501\u5b9a\u5c4f\u5e55\u4e0a\u663e\u793a\u6b65\u9aa4\u3001\u914d\u5bf9\u7801\u548c\u6279\u51c6\u8bf7\u6c42\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u6703\u5728\u9396\u5b9a\u87a2\u5e55\u4e0a\u986f\u793a\u6b65\u9a5f\u3001\u914d\u5c0d\u78bc\u548c\u6279\u51c6\u8acb\u6c42\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno shows steps, pairing codes, and approvals on the Lock Screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u4f1a\u5728\u9501\u5b9a\u5c4f\u5e55\u4e0a\u663e\u793a\u64cd\u4f5c\u6b65\u9aa4\u3001\u914d\u5bf9\u7801\u548c\u6279\u51c6\u8bf7\u6c42\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u6703\u5728\u9396\u5b9a\u87a2\u5e55\u4e0a\u986f\u793a\u64cd\u4f5c\u6b65\u9a5f\u3001\u914d\u5c0d\u78bc\u548c\u6279\u51c6\u8acb\u6c42\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno signs in again when its signing is due, and asks you for the password then.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7b7e\u540d\u5230\u671f\u65f6 Qeno \u4f1a\u91cd\u65b0\u767b\u5f55\uff0c\u5c4a\u65f6\u4f1a\u5411\u4f60\u8be2\u95ee\u5bc6\u7801\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u7c3d\u540d\u5230\u671f\u6642 Qeno \u6703\u91cd\u65b0\u767b\u5165\uff0c\u5c46\u6642\u6703\u5411\u4f60\u8a62\u554f\u5bc6\u78bc\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno starts it again on the next agent request.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u4e0b\u6b21\u8bf7\u6c42\u65f6\uff0cQeno \u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u91cd\u542f\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u667a\u6167\u9ad4\u4e0b\u6b21\u8acb\u6c42\u6642\uff0cQeno \u6703\u81ea\u52d5\u91cd\u555f\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno restarts it on the next agent request."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno stays active in the background without the location indicator, and never records your location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u5728\u540e\u53f0\u4fdd\u6301\u8fd0\u884c\u4e14\u4e0d\u663e\u793a\u5b9a\u4f4d\u56fe\u6807\uff0c\u7edd\u4e0d\u8bb0\u5f55\u4f4d\u7f6e\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u5728\u80cc\u666f\u4fdd\u6301\u57f7\u884c\u4e14\u4e0d\u986f\u793a\u5b9a\u4f4d\u5716\u793a\uff0c\u7d55\u4e0d\u8a18\u9304\u4f4d\u7f6e\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno stays active in the background without the location indicator and never records your location."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno stopped waiting because the server did not answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u91cd\u8bd5\u3002\u670d\u52a1\u5668\u672a\u53ca\u65f6\u5e94\u7b54\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u91cd\u8a66\u3002\u4f3a\u670d\u5668\u672a\u53ca\u6642\u61c9\u7b54\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try again. The server didn\u2019t answer in time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno stops opening after %@. Connect this iPhone to your Mac and ask your agent to renew it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u5c06\u6b64 iPhone \u8fde\u4e0a Mac \u5e76\u8ba9\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u7eed\u7b7e\u3002Qeno \u5c06\u5728 %@ \u540e\u65e0\u6cd5\u6253\u5f00\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u5c07\u6b64 iPhone \u9023\u4e0a Mac \u4e26\u8b93\u667a\u6167\u9ad4\u7e8c\u7c3d\u3002Qeno \u5c07\u5728 %@ \u5f8c\u7121\u6cd5\u958b\u555f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect this iPhone to your Mac and ask your agent to renew signing. Qeno expires after %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno stops opening after %lld. Connect this iPhone to your Mac and ask your agent to renew it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u5c06\u6b64 iPhone \u8fde\u4e0a Mac \u5e76\u8ba9\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u7eed\u7b7e\u3002Qeno \u5c06\u5728 %lld \u540e\u65e0\u6cd5\u6253\u5f00\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u5c07\u6b64 iPhone \u9023\u4e0a Mac \u4e26\u8b93\u667a\u6167\u9ad4\u7e8c\u7c3d\u3002Qeno \u5c07\u5728 %lld \u5f8c\u7121\u6cd5\u958b\u555f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect this iPhone to your Mac and ask your agent to renew signing. Qeno expires after %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno types through its own keyboard and never touches the clipboard. When the keyboard can\u2019t be used, plain text is typed with key presses, and other text is not entered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u901a\u8fc7\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u952e\u76d8\u8f93\u5165\uff0c\u7edd\u4e0d\u4f7f\u7528\u526a\u8d34\u677f\u3002\u952e\u76d8\u65e0\u6cd5\u4f7f\u7528\u65f6\uff0c\u666e\u901a\u6587\u5b57\u7528\u6309\u952e\u8f93\u5165\uff0c\u5176\u4ed6\u6587\u5b57\u4e0d\u4f1a\u8f93\u5165\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u900f\u904e\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u9375\u76e4\u8f38\u5165\uff0c\u7d55\u4e0d\u4f7f\u7528\u526a\u8cbc\u7c3f\u3002\u9375\u76e4\u7121\u6cd5\u4f7f\u7528\u6642\uff0c\u666e\u901a\u6587\u5b57\u7528\u6309\u9375\u8f38\u5165\uff0c\u5176\u4ed6\u6587\u5b57\u4e0d\u6703\u8f38\u5165\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno types through its own keyboard panel, at a person\u2019s pace. The panel has no keys. It shows while Qeno types, and Take Over stops it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u901a\u8fc7\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u952e\u76d8\u9762\u677f\u4ee5\u5e38\u4eba\u7684\u901f\u5ea6\u8f93\u5165\u3002\u9762\u677f\u6ca1\u6709\u6309\u952e\u3002Qeno \u8f93\u5165\u65f6\u663e\u793a\uff0c\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c\u63a5\u7ba1\u201d\u5373\u53ef\u505c\u6b62\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u900f\u904e\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u9375\u76e4\u9762\u677f\u4ee5\u5e38\u4eba\u7684\u901f\u5ea6\u8f38\u5165\u3002\u9762\u677f\u6c92\u6709\u6309\u9375\u3002Qeno \u8f38\u5165\u6642\u986f\u793a\uff0c\u8f15\u9ede\u300c\u63a5\u7ba1\u300d\u5373\u53ef\u505c\u6b62\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno types through its own keyboard panel, at a person\u2019s pace. The panel has no keys: it shows while Qeno types, and Take Over stops it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u901a\u8fc7\u81ea\u5df1\u7684\u952e\u76d8\u9762\u677f\u4ee5\u5e38\u4eba\u7684\u901f\u5ea6\u8f93\u5165\u3002\u9762\u677f\u6ca1\u6709\u6309\u952e\uff1aQeno \u8f93\u5165\u65f6\u663e\u793a\uff0c\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c\u63a5\u7ba1\u201d\u5373\u53ef\u505c\u6b62\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno types with key presses and pastes what the keys can\u2019t type, such as Chinese and emoji. Your clipboard is put back afterwards. The Qeno keyboard is not used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u7528\u6309\u952e\u8f93\u5165\uff0c\u6309\u952e\u65e0\u6cd5\u8f93\u5165\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\uff08\u5982\u4e2d\u6587\u548c\u8868\u60c5\u7b26\u53f7\uff09\u901a\u8fc7\u7c98\u8d34\u8f93\u5165\uff0c\u4e4b\u540e\u4f1a\u6062\u590d\u4f60\u7684\u526a\u8d34\u677f\u3002\u4e0d\u4f7f\u7528 Qeno \u952e\u76d8\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u7528\u6309\u9375\u8f38\u5165\uff0c\u6309\u9375\u7121\u6cd5\u8f38\u5165\u7684\u5167\u5bb9\uff08\u5982\u4e2d\u6587\u548c\u8868\u60c5\u7b26\u865f\uff09\u900f\u904e\u8cbc\u4e0a\u8f38\u5165\uff0c\u4e4b\u5f8c\u6703\u6062\u5fa9\u4f60\u7684\u526a\u8cbc\u7c3f\u3002\u4e0d\u4f7f\u7528 Qeno \u9375\u76e4\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno uses Apple\u2019s developer tools on this iPhone. Keep all of these on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u901a\u8fc7 Apple \u7684\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u5de5\u5177\u64cd\u4f5c\u6b64 iPhone\uff0c\u4ee5\u4e0a\u5404\u9879\u9700\u4fdd\u6301\u5f00\u542f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u900f\u904e Apple \u7684\u958b\u767c\u8005\u5de5\u5177\u64cd\u4f5c\u6b64 iPhone\uff0c\u4ee5\u4e0a\u5404\u9805\u9700\u4fdd\u6301\u958b\u555f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno uses your ChatGPT Plus or Pro plan through OpenAI\u2019s Sign in with ChatGPT. The sign-in stays in this iPhone\u2019s Keychain. An OpenAI API key works too, as a backup. Add it under OpenAI.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u901a\u8fc7 OpenAI \u7684\u201c\u4f7f\u7528 ChatGPT \u767b\u5f55\u201d\u4f7f\u7528\u4f60\u7684 ChatGPT Plus \u6216 Pro \u5957\u9910\u3002\u767b\u5f55\u4fe1\u606f\u4fdd\u5b58\u5728\u6b64 iPhone \u7684\u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\u3002\u4e5f\u53ef\u4ee5\u7528 OpenAI API \u5bc6\u94a5\u4f5c\u4e3a\u5907\u7528\uff0c\u8bf7\u5728 OpenAI \u4e0b\u6dfb\u52a0\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u900f\u904e OpenAI \u7684\u300c\u4f7f\u7528 ChatGPT \u767b\u5165\u300d\u4f7f\u7528\u4f60\u7684 ChatGPT Plus \u6216 Pro \u5957\u9910\u3002\u767b\u5165\u8cc7\u8a0a\u5132\u5b58\u5728\u6b64 iPhone \u7684\u9470\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\u3002\u4e5f\u53ef\u4ee5\u7528 OpenAI API \u91d1\u9470\u4f5c\u70ba\u5099\u7528\uff0c\u8acb\u5728 OpenAI \u4e0b\u65b0\u589e\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno uses your ChatGPT Plus or Pro plan through OpenAI\u2019s Sign in with ChatGPT. The sign-in stays in this iPhone\u2019s Keychain. An OpenAI API key works too, as a backup: add it under OpenAI.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno uses your ChatGPT Plus or Pro plan via Sign in with ChatGPT, stored in this iPhone\u2019s Keychain. You can also add an OpenAI API key under OpenAI as a backup."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u901a\u8fc7\u201c\u4f7f\u7528 ChatGPT \u767b\u5f55\u201d\u5171\u4eab\u4f60\u7684 ChatGPT Plus \u6216 Pro \u989d\u5ea6\uff0c\u767b\u5f55\u4fe1\u606f\u4fdd\u5b58\u5728\u672c\u673a\u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\u3002\u4e5f\u53ef\u5728 OpenAI \u4e0b\u6dfb\u52a0 API \u5bc6\u94a5\u4f5c\u4e3a\u5907\u7528\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u900f\u904e\u300c\u4f7f\u7528 ChatGPT \u767b\u5165\u300d\u5171\u4eab\u4f60\u7684 ChatGPT Plus \u6216 Pro \u984d\u5ea6\uff0c\u767b\u5165\u8cc7\u8a0a\u5132\u5b58\u5728\u672c\u6a5f\u9470\u5319\u5708\u4e2d\u3002\u4e5f\u53ef\u5728 OpenAI \u4e0b\u65b0\u589e API \u91d1\u9470\u4f5c\u70ba\u5099\u7528\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno uses your ChatGPT plan, the way Codex does. The sign-in stays in this iPhone\u2019s Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u4e0e Codex \u4e00\u6837\uff0c\u5171\u4eab\u4f60\u7684 ChatGPT \u8ba2\u9605\u989d\u5ea6\u3002\u767b\u5f55\u4fe1\u606f\u4ec5\u4fdd\u5b58\u5728\u6b64 iPhone \u7684\u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u8207 Codex \u4e00\u6a23\uff0c\u5171\u4eab\u4f60\u7684 ChatGPT \u8a02\u95b1\u984d\u5ea6\u3002\u767b\u5165\u8cc7\u8a0a\u50c5\u5132\u5b58\u5728\u6b64 iPhone \u7684\u9470\u5319\u4e32\u4e2d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno waits until you hand it back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ea4\u8fd8\u540e\u7ee7\u7eed\u6267\u884c\u4efb\u52a1\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ea4\u9084\u5f8c\u7e7c\u7e8c\u57f7\u884c\u4efb\u52d9\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno will close by itself. Open it again once the update is in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u5c06\u81ea\u52a8\u5173\u95ed\uff0c\u66f4\u65b0\u5b8c\u6210\u540e\u8bf7\u91cd\u65b0\u6253\u5f00\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u5c07\u81ea\u52d5\u95dc\u9589\uff0c\u66f4\u65b0\u5b8c\u6210\u5f8c\u8acb\u91cd\u65b0\u958b\u555f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno will close automatically. Reopen it once the update finishes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno will open Settings. Go to **Privacy & Security \u203a Developer Mode** and tap **Pair with Qeno**.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u5c06\u6253\u5f00\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u201d\u3002\u524d\u5f80\u201c**\u9690\u79c1\u4e0e\u5b89\u5168 \u203a \u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f**\u201d\u5e76\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c**\u4e0e Qeno \u914d\u5bf9**\u201d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qeno \u5c07\u958b\u555f\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u300d\u3002\u524d\u5f80\u300c**\u96b1\u79c1\u6b0a\u8207\u5b89\u5168\u6027 \u203a \u958b\u767c\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f**\u300d\u4e26\u9ede\u4e00\u4e0b\u300c**\u8207 Qeno \u914d\u5c0d**\u300d\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Qeno, %@, details": {
      "localizations": {
