          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk with Qeno needs an OpenAI API key. Add one in Settings. Dictate works without it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u548c Qeno \u5bf9\u8bdd\u9700\u8981 OpenAI API \u5bc6\u94a5\uff0c\u8bf7\u5728\u8bbe\u7f6e\u91cc\u6dfb\u52a0\u3002\u542c\u5199\u4e0d\u9700\u8981\u5bc6\u94a5\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u548c Qeno \u5c0d\u8a71\u9700\u8981 OpenAI API \u91d1\u9470\uff0c\u8acb\u5728\u8a2d\u5b9a\u88e1\u65b0\u589e\u3002\u807d\u5beb\u4e0d\u9700\u8981\u91d1\u9470\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk with Qeno then needs an OpenAI API key, or the address entered again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79fb\u9664\u540e\uff0c\u548c Qeno \u5bf9\u8bdd\u9700\u8981 OpenAI API \u5bc6\u94a5\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u91cd\u65b0\u8f93\u5165\u8fd9\u4e2a\u5730\u5740\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u79fb\u9664\u5f8c\uff0c\u548c Qeno \u5c0d\u8a71\u9700\u8981 OpenAI API \u91d1\u9470\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u91cd\u65b0\u8f38\u5165\u9019\u500b\u5730\u5740\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk with Qeno uses Live Voice on your OpenAI account. Turn it on in Settings. Dictate works without it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u548c Qeno \u5bf9\u8bdd\u7528\u7684\u662f OpenAI \u8d26\u6237\u7684\u5b9e\u65f6\u8bed\u97f3\uff0c\u8bf7\u5728\u8bbe\u7f6e\u91cc\u6253\u5f00\u3002\u542c\u5199\u4e0d\u9700\u8981\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u548c Qeno \u5c0d\u8a71\u7528\u7684\u662f OpenAI \u5e33\u6236\u7684\u5be6\u6642\u8a9e\u97f3\uff0c\u8acb\u5728\u8a2d\u5b9a\u88e1\u958b\u555f\u3002\u807d\u5beb\u4e0d\u9700\u8981\u5b83\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Open Settings** below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8f7b\u70b9\u4e0b\u65b9\u7684**\u6253\u5f00\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e\u201d**\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8f15\u9ede\u4e0b\u65b9\u7684**\u958b\u555f\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u300d**\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Pair with Qeno** and enter the code shown here and on the Lock Screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8f7b\u70b9\u201c**\u4e0e Qeno \u914d\u5bf9**\u201d\uff0c\u5e76\u8f93\u5165\u6b64\u5904\u6216\u9501\u5b9a\u5c4f\u5e55\u4e0a\u663e\u793a\u7684\u914d\u5bf9\u7801\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8f15\u9ede\u300c**\u8207 Qeno \u914d\u5c0d**\u300d\uff0c\u4e26\u8f38\u5165\u6b64\u8655\u6216\u9396\u5b9a\u87a2\u5e55\u4e0a\u986f\u793a\u7684\u914d\u5c0d\u78bc\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Qeno** in that list and turn on **Allow Full Access**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u5217\u8868\u4e2d\u8f7b\u70b9 **Qeno**\uff0c\u6253\u5f00**\u5141\u8bb8\u5b8c\u5168\u8bbf\u95ee**\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u5217\u8868\u4e2d\u8f15\u9ede **Qeno**\uff0c\u958b\u555f**\u5141\u8a31\u5b8c\u5168\u8a2a\u554f**\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Allow or Don\u2019t Allow in the Live Activity, a notification, or Qeno.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
