            "value": "The agent is running a step, %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The answer was cut off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u56de\u590d\u5df2\u622a\u65ad\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u56de\u8986\u5df2\u622a\u65b7\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The approval ran out, so Qeno skipped that step": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6279\u51c6\u8d85\u65f6\uff0c\u5df2\u8df3\u8fc7\u6b64\u6b65\u9aa4"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6279\u51c6\u8d85\u6642\uff0c\u5df2\u8df3\u904e\u6b64\u6b65\u9a5f"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The built-in connection runs on a physical iPhone. External connection options are shown below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5185\u7f6e\u8fde\u63a5\u53ea\u80fd\u5728\u771f\u673a\u4e0a\u8fd0\u884c\u3002\u4e0b\u65b9\u5217\u51fa\u5916\u90e8\u8fde\u63a5\u65b9\u5f0f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5167\u5efa\u9023\u7dda\u53ea\u80fd\u5728\u771f\u6a5f\u4e0a\u57f7\u884c\u3002\u4e0b\u65b9\u5217\u51fa\u5916\u90e8\u9023\u7dda\u65b9\u5f0f\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The built-in connection runs on a physical iPhone. Use your proxy app above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5185\u7f6e\u8fde\u63a5\u53ea\u80fd\u5728\u771f\u673a\u4e0a\u8fd0\u884c\u3002\u8bf7\u4f7f\u7528\u4e0a\u65b9\u7684\u4ee3\u7406 App\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5167\u5efa\u9023\u7dda\u53ea\u80fd\u5728\u771f\u6a5f\u4e0a\u57f7\u884c\u3002\u8acb\u4f7f\u7528\u4e0a\u65b9\u7684\u4ee3\u7406 App\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The developer disk image did not install. Qeno downloads it again by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u78c1\u76d8\u6620\u50cf\u672a\u80fd\u5b89\u88c5\uff0cQeno \u4f1a\u81ea\u52a8\u91cd\u65b0\u4e0b\u8f7d\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u958b\u767c\u8005\u78c1\u789f\u6620\u50cf\u672a\u80fd\u5b89\u88dd\uff0cQeno \u6703\u81ea\u52d5\u91cd\u65b0\u4e0b\u8f09\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The developer disk image is not downloaded yet (Setup > Pair). It is needed once.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u524d\u5f80\u201c\u914d\u7f6e \u203a \u914d\u5bf9\u201d\u4e0b\u8f7d\u4e00\u6b21\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u78c1\u76d8\u6620\u50cf\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u524d\u5f80\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u7cbe\u9748 \u203a \u914d\u5c0d\u300d\u4e0b\u8f09\u4e00\u6b21\u958b\u767c\u8005\u78c1\u789f\u6620\u50cf\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download the developer disk image once in Setup \u203a Pairing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first time Qeno Runner starts after a restart, iOS asks for your passcode to allow automation. Enter it once; Qeno never sees it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone \u91cd\u65b0\u542f\u52a8\u540e\u9996\u6b21\u542f\u52a8 Qeno Runner \u65f6\uff0ciOS \u4f1a\u8981\u6c42\u8f93\u5165\u9501\u5c4f\u5bc6\u7801\u4ee5\u5141\u8bb8\u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u64cd\u4f5c\u3002\u53ea\u9700\u8f93\u5165\u4e00\u6b21\uff0cQeno \u65e0\u6cd5\u8bfb\u53d6\u8be5\u5bc6\u7801\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone \u91cd\u65b0\u555f\u52d5\u5f8c\u9996\u6b21\u555f\u52d5 Qeno Runner \u6642\uff0ciOS \u6703\u8981\u6c42\u8f38\u5165\u9396\u5c4f\u5bc6\u78bc\u4ee5\u5141\u8a31\u81ea\u52d5\u5316\u64cd\u4f5c\u3002\u53ea\u9700\u8f38\u5165\u4e00\u6b21\uff0cQeno \u7121\u6cd5\u8b80\u53d6\u8a72\u5bc6\u78bc\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first time Qeno Runner starts after a restart, iOS asks for your passcode to allow automation. Enter it once. Qeno never sees it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first time Qeno turns on after a restart, iOS asks for your passcode to allow automation. Enter it once; Qeno never sees it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u91cd\u542f\u540e\u9996\u6b21\u5f00\u542f Qeno \u65f6\uff0ciOS \u4f1a\u8981\u6c42\u8f93\u5165\u9501\u5c4f\u5bc6\u7801\u4ee5\u5141\u8bb8\u81ea\u52a8\u5316\u3002\u8f93\u5165\u4e00\u6b21\u5373\u53ef\uff0cQeno \u65e0\u6cd5\u8bfb\u53d6\u5bc6\u7801\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first time Qeno turns on after a restart, iOS asks for your passcode to allow automation. Enter it once; Qeno never sees it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u91cd\u555f\u5f8c\u9996\u6b21\u958b\u555f Qeno \u6642\uff0ciOS \u6703\u8981\u6c42\u8f38\u5165\u9396\u5b9a\u756b\u9762\u5bc6\u78bc\u4ee5\u5141\u8a31\u81ea\u52d5\u5316\u3002\u8f38\u5165\u4e00\u6b21\u5373\u53ef\uff0cQeno \u7121\u6cd5\u8b80\u53d6\u5bc6\u78bc\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The helper app that taps and types for your agent. Qeno starts it; you never open it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ee3\u667a\u80fd\u4f53\u6267\u884c\u70b9\u51fb\u548c\u8f93\u5165\u7684\u8f85\u52a9 App\u3002\u7531 Qeno \u81ea\u52a8\u542f\u52a8\uff0c\u65e0\u9700\u624b\u52a8\u6253\u5f00\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u4ee3\u667a\u6167\u9ad4\u57f7\u884c\u9ede\u64ca\u548c\u8f38\u5165\u7684\u8f14\u52a9 App\u3002\u7531 Qeno \u81ea\u52d5\u555f\u52d5\uff0c\u7121\u9700\u624b\u52d5\u958b\u555f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The helper app that taps and types for your agent. Qeno starts it automatically; don\u2019t open it yourself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is not valid. Check that it was copied in full.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The key is not valid. Check that it was copied in full."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5bc6\u94a5\u65e0\u6548\uff0c\u8bf7\u786e\u8ba4\u5bc6\u94a5\u5df2\u5b8c\u6574\u590d\u5236\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u91d1\u9470\u7121\u6548\uff0c\u8acb\u78ba\u8a8d\u91d1\u9470\u5df2\u5b8c\u6574\u8907\u88fd\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keychain did not take the key. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u91cd\u65b0\u4fdd\u5b58\u5bc6\u94a5\u3002\u65e0\u6cd5\u5199\u5165\u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u91cd\u65b0\u5132\u5b58\u91d1\u9470\u3002\u7121\u6cd5\u5beb\u5165\u9470\u5319\u5708\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try saving the key again. Keychain couldn\u2019t store it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keychain did not take the sign-in. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u91cd\u65b0\u767b\u5f55\u3002\u65e0\u6cd5\u5c06\u767b\u5f55\u4fe1\u606f\u5199\u5165\u94a5\u5319\u4e32\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u91cd\u65b0\u767b\u5165\u3002\u7121\u6cd5\u5c07\u767b\u5165\u8cc7\u8a0a\u5beb\u5165\u9470\u5319\u5708\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try signing in again. Keychain couldn\u2019t store your sign-in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The latest screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6700\u65b0\u753b\u9762"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u6700\u65b0\u756b\u9762"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local VPN did not connect within 15 seconds. Try again, or choose an external connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u91cd\u8bd5\uff0c\u6216\u6539\u7528\u5916\u90e8\u8fde\u63a5\u3002\u672c\u673a VPN \u8fde\u63a5\u8d85\u65f6\uff0815 \u79d2\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u91cd\u8a66\uff0c\u6216\u6539\u7528\u5916\u90e8\u9023\u7dda\u3002\u672c\u6a5f VPN \u9023\u7dda\u903e\u6642\uff0815 \u79d2\uff09\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try again or choose an external connection. The local VPN timed out after 15 seconds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local VPN disconnected. Reconnect here. If it keeps stopping, check that both Qeno and its tunnel were signed with Network Extensions, or choose an external connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u5728\u6b64\u91cd\u65b0\u8fde\u63a5\uff1b\u82e5\u53cd\u590d\u65ad\u5f00\uff0c\u8bf7\u68c0\u67e5\u7b7e\u540d\u662f\u5426\u542b\u7f51\u7edc\u6269\u5c55\u6216\u6539\u7528\u5916\u90e8\u8fde\u63a5\u3002\u672c\u673a VPN \u5df2\u65ad\u5f00\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u5728\u6b64\u91cd\u65b0\u9023\u7dda\uff1b\u82e5\u53cd\u8986\u4e2d\u65b7\uff0c\u8acb\u6aa2\u67e5\u7c3d\u540d\u662f\u5426\u542b\u7db2\u8def\u5ef6\u4f38\u529f\u80fd\u6216\u6539\u7528\u5916\u90e8\u9023\u7dda\u3002\u672c\u6a5f VPN \u5df2\u4e2d\u65b7\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reconnect here, or choose an external connection if signing lacks Network Extensions. The local VPN disconnected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local VPN needs a physical iPhone. Its network connection cannot be tested in the Simulator.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u5728 iPhone \u771f\u673a\u4e0a\u6d4b\u8bd5\u3002\u6a21\u62df\u5668\u4e0d\u652f\u6301\u672c\u673a VPN\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u5728 iPhone \u5be6\u6a5f\u4e0a\u6e2c\u8a66\u3002\u6a21\u64ec\u5668\u4e0d\u652f\u63f4\u672c\u6a5f VPN\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Test on a physical iPhone. The local VPN doesn\u2019t run in Simulator."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local connection is off. Turn Qeno on to reconnect, or choose an external connection in Setup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u5f00\u542f Qeno \u91cd\u65b0\u8fde\u63a5\uff0c\u6216\u5728\u201c\u914d\u7f6e\u201d\u4e2d\u6539\u7528\u5916\u90e8\u8fde\u63a5\u3002\u672c\u673a\u8fde\u63a5\u5df2\u5173\u95ed\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u958b\u555f Qeno \u91cd\u65b0\u9023\u7dda\uff0c\u6216\u5728\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u7cbe\u9748\u300d\u4e2d\u6539\u7528\u5916\u90e8\u9023\u7dda\u3002\u672c\u6a5f\u9023\u7dda\u5df2\u95dc\u9589\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn Qeno on to reconnect, or choose an external connection in Setup. Local Connection is off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local connection is still stopping. Try again in a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u7a0d\u5019\u518d\u8bd5\u3002\u672c\u673a\u8fde\u63a5\u6b63\u5728\u505c\u6b62\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u7a0d\u5019\u518d\u8a66\u3002\u672c\u6a5f\u9023\u7dda\u6b63\u5728\u505c\u6b62\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wait a moment and try again. Local Connection is still stopping."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local interface is present, but this iPhone does not answer at 10.7.0.1. Reconnect the local connection and check Wi-Fi. If it still does not answer, pair again in Setup \u203a Pairing, then check Developer Mode.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8bf7\u91cd\u8fde\u672c\u673a\u8fde\u63a5\u5e76\u68c0\u67e5 Wi-Fi\u3002\u82e5 10.7.0.1 \u4ecd\u65e0\u5e94\u7b54\uff0c\u8bf7\u5230\u201c\u914d\u7f6e \u203a \u914d\u5bf9\u201d\u91cd\u65b0\u914d\u5bf9\u5e76\u68c0\u67e5\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8acb\u91cd\u9023\u672c\u6a5f\u9023\u7dda\u4e26\u6aa2\u67e5 Wi-Fi\u3002\u82e5 10.7.0.1 \u4ecd\u7121\u61c9\u7b54\uff0c\u8acb\u5230\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u7cbe\u9748 \u203a \u914d\u5c0d\u300d\u91cd\u65b0\u914d\u5c0d\u4e26\u6aa2\u67e5\u958b\u767c\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reconnect Local Connection and check Wi-Fi. If 10.7.0.1 still doesn\u2019t answer, pair again in Setup \u203a Pairing and check Developer Mode."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local interface is present, but this iPhone's developer services do not answer. Check Developer Mode and Wi-Fi, then reconnect the local connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u672c\u673a\u63a5\u53e3\u5df2\u5b58\u5728\uff0c\u4f46\u6b64 iPhone \u7684\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u670d\u52a1\u6ca1\u6709\u5e94\u7b54\u3002\u8bf7\u68c0\u67e5\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u6a21\u5f0f\u548c\u65e0\u7ebf\u5c40\u57df\u7f51\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u91cd\u65b0\u8fde\u63a5\u672c\u673a\u8fde\u63a5\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The loopback is on. iOS moved its pairing service to another port, and Qeno finds it through the local network. Keep Wi-Fi on and allow Local Network for Qeno in Settings \u2192 Privacy & Security. If this stays, restart the iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u56de\u73af\u5df2\u5f00\u542f\u3002iOS \u628a\u914d\u5bf9\u670d\u52a1\u6362\u5230\u4e86\u53e6\u4e00\u4e2a\u7aef\u53e3\uff0cQeno \u4f1a\u901a\u8fc7\u672c\u5730\u7f51\u7edc\u627e\u5230\u5b83\u3002\u8bf7\u4fdd\u6301\u65e0\u7ebf\u5c40\u57df\u7f51\u5f00\u542f\uff0c\u5e76\u5728\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u9690\u79c1\u4e0e\u5b89\u5168 \u203a \u672c\u5730\u7f51\u7edc\u201d\u4e2d\u5141\u8bb8 Qeno\u3002\u5982\u679c\u4ecd\u672a\u6062\u590d\uff0c\u8bf7\u91cd\u65b0\u542f\u52a8 iPhone\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u8ff4\u74b0\u5df2\u958b\u555f\u3002iOS \u628a\u914d\u5c0d\u670d\u52d9\u63db\u5230\u4e86\u53e6\u4e00\u500b\u9023\u63a5\u57e0\uff0cQeno \u6703\u900f\u904e\u5340\u57df\u7db2\u8def\u627e\u5230\u5b83\u3002\u8acb\u4fdd\u6301\u7121\u7dda\u5340\u57df\u7db2\u958b\u555f\uff0c\u4e26\u5728\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a \u203a \u96b1\u79c1\u6b0a\u8207\u5b89\u5168\u6027 \u203a \u5340\u57df\u7db2\u8def\u300d\u4e2d\u5141\u8a31 Qeno\u3002\u5982\u679c\u4ecd\u672a\u6062\u5fa9\uff0c\u8acb\u91cd\u65b0\u555f\u52d5 iPhone\u3002"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model %@ doesn\u2019t exist, or this key can\u2019t use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
