          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on the loopback in your proxy app: the Qeno module in Surge or Loon, loopback_address in sing-box, or Shadowrocket's Settings \u2192 Other \u2192 \"Include route 10.7.0.1/32\". Then connect to Wi-Fi.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u4ee3\u7406 App \u4e2d\u5f00\u542f\u56de\u73af\uff0c\u53ef\u4ee5\u662f Surge \u6216 Loon \u7684 Qeno \u6a21\u5757\u3001sing-box \u7684 loopback_address\uff0c\u6216 Shadowrocket \u7684\u201c\u8bbe\u7f6e \u203a \u5176\u4ed6 \u203a \u5305\u542b\u8def\u7531 10.7.0.1/32\u201d\u3002\u7136\u540e\u8fde\u63a5\u65e0\u7ebf\u5c40\u57df\u7f51\u3002"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\u5728\u4ee3\u7406 App \u4e2d\u958b\u555f\u8ff4\u74b0\uff0c\u53ef\u4ee5\u662f Surge \u6216 Loon \u7684 Qeno \u6a21\u7d44\u3001sing-box \u7684 loopback_address\uff0c\u6216 Shadowrocket \u7684\u300c\u8a2d\u5b9a \u203a \u5176\u4ed6 \u203a \u5305\u542b\u8def\u7531 10.7.0.1/32\u300d\u3002\u7136\u5f8c\u9023\u7dda\u7121\u7dda\u5340\u57df\u7db2\u3002"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on the loopback in your proxy app. That is the Qeno module in Surge or Loon, loopback_address in sing-box, or Shadowrocket's Settings \u2192 Other \u2192 \"Include route 10.7.0.1/32\". Then connect to Wi-Fi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on your proxy app with the Qeno module, or connect LocalDevVPN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
